 "description": "AR-15: LMT Defense R20 RAHE Reference Rifle (CQBMLK143PW-MARS-EST), visual art model. Barrel 14.3 in (363 mm) from the bolt face (origin, x = 0) with the pinned and welded flash hider ending at 16.0 in (406 mm), per LMT and Silencer Shop. Proportions follow the official LMT side photo (5449 px, 6.45 px/mm from the Picatinny pitch); overall length on that photo is about 824 mm (stock one click out), published 800-808 mm collapsed and 884-891 mm extended. Height from the raised LMT front sight to the PMAG floorplate about 269-271 mm on the photo (model 270.8). Widths: buffer tube 1.148 in (29.16 mm), Picatinny 21.2 mm, PMAG body 25.2 mm, M-LOK slots 32 x 7 mm at 40 mm pitch; handguard 38 mm and receivers 29.2 / 24.2 mm are estimates (no top view). The bore and the barrel extension are open; the magazine well and the ejection port are sampled with rays. Text inlays (AR_Mark_*, AR_StockText_*) are open thin solids from font curves and are excluded from the closed-part check. Revision 2 (2026-10-15, after review v1): A2-type forward assist at the rear, wedge deflector, LMT folding sights, MOE SL-K pocket/lever/badge/rubber pad, PMAG Gen M3 window grid, slanted magwell lip, MARS-L bolt catch, trigger and guard per photo, rear tower/castle nut/end plate moved to the photo positions.",
